✗ Timeout waiting for client connection

This is expected - no client connected within 10 seconds.

Server Example Complete

In a production server:
1. Create listener with NewShmListener()
2. Create gRPC server with grpc.NewServer()
3. Register your service implementations
4. Call server.Serve(listener) - blocks handling RPCs
5. Accept() will be called internally for each client

